*> A menu that names the programs it can start in a table, and starts
*> them through a data item.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENU.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  MENU-PROGRAMS.
    05  FILLER         PIC X(8) VALUE "PAYRPT".
    05  FILLER         PIC X(8) VALUE "PAYMENU".
01  MENU-TABLE REDEFINES MENU-PROGRAMS.
    05  MENU-PROGRAM   PIC X(8) OCCURS 2.
01  CHOICE             PIC 9 VALUE 1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM(MENU-PROGRAM(CHOICE)) END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
